{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Killer Chat! Expanded Edition</strong> fleshes out our  dark satirical serial killer dating chatsim <i>Killer Chat!</i> to make your time in the slaughterhouse bigger, better and bloodier than ever before with fresh routes, interactions, endings, art, achievements, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1762610521 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>After asking too many murder-related questions online (for your book), you get an invite to a... serial killer chatroom?!\u00a0What the...?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SO YOU'RE A SERIAL KILLER. SUPPOSEDLY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A reporter by day, an aspiring writer by night: you've been asking all the important questions on the dark web.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Like, how do you bury a body?\u00a0How do you kill someone with a crowbar with the right angle to cause blunt-force trauma? What's the best way to hide from law enforcement?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you're to write a good crime book, this is how you'll do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Suddenly, <strong>ERROR! UNKNOWN\u00a0</strong>invites you to a server... with a warning.\u00a0&quot;don't be so obvious smh You're Gonna\u00a0Get\u00a0Caught&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It's a serial killer chatroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You may be slightly screwed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/e981685e6f455a23dd14d6cd87a1b98a.avif?t=1762610521\" width=184 height=184 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO HELL, LOSERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a (fully customisable!) character as you\u2026\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desperately pretend to be a serial killer. So they don't kick you out. Or kill you. Oh god, they might kill you.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know some killers. You might as well. No better chance to gather accurate first-hand data for your book.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huh, they're actually kind of nice? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh shit, he's hot. And she's hot.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you can\u2026 date\u2026 some murderers?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What even is your life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yup, you heard us right!\u00a0<i>Killer Chat!</i> is a dark satire romance\u00a0chatsim\u00a0where you date serial killers. Pretend to be a serial killer, get inspiration for your book,\u00a0fall in love,\u00a0and try not to call the cops through a whirlwind six months with your murderous beau of choice.\u00a0 Who knows? You might find your happily ever after... or headline the news as a gruesomely lovesick\u00a0corpse. It's honestly up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/65eaaad80057398992547c311a0e3b09.avif?t=1762610521 width=800 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT'S NEW?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Killer Chat! Expanded Edition</strong> will be bigger, better, and bloodier than ever before, including at minimum:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 </strong>120k+ words (at least double the size of Killer Chat! Original Edition.)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc92 20+ endings (via\u00a0story-rich, choice-based branching.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 14+ CGs\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270f\ufe0f 10+ partial CGs\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude4b 8 sprites\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Fully voice-acted video and voice calls!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f CG and art gallery\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 50+ achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Original OST with 10+ soundtracks and custom sound effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE THE SLAUGHTERHOUSE YOUR SLAUGHTERHOME!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udec0 Get to know your fellow\u00a0serials through DMs, group calls, voice &amp; video calls (and spam their friend requests).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2a\u00a0 Express yourself by changing your bio, profile pic, server roles and statuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/07a1ff50fc15837b427d54e2f8945954.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/07a1ff50fc15837b427d54e2f8945954.avif?t=1762610521 width=800 height=398 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udec0 Keep yourself guessing with random character events in each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2a Unique relationship dynamics with all characters in every playthrough. Develop wonderful (or  hostile!) relationships with the server members with expanded friendship routes! Be warned - these interactions will now have a significant impact on the plot... and your lifespan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/b78c00ad5a38c445e246fbdcddb4af31.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/b78c00ad5a38c445e246fbdcddb4af31.webp?t=1762610521 width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTSIDE THE CHATROOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As much fun as risking your life lying to a bunch of murderers is, sometimes you need a break. You can now access your PC desktop, where you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdd Write your book (it\u2019s the only reason you\u2019re there, right?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8c Write love letters (okay, maybe not the only reason\u2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play some minigames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude9e Change your appearance with our virtual closet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Keep track of your achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Keep track of your knowledge and relationships with the server... for research purposes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE WHO\u00a0YOU WANT TO BE!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/c652f1a1005f1bf58b2e4896ba464531.avif?t=1762610521\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a customisable MC!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to your appearance, you can customise your:\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd8a\ufe0f\u00a0</strong>Name/Username</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a7\ufe0f\u00a0</strong>Gender\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff3\ufe0f\u200d\ud83c\udf08\u00a0</strong>Sexuality\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2652\u00a0</strong>Personality\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u00a0</strong>Alibi and Moniker (we\u2019re sure you\u2019ll come up with something convincing\u2026)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2a What kind of pseudo serial killer you are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customisation and choices will impact dialogue and relationships, making each playthrough feel more distinct and your MC feel alive (... or dead).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/6a66c38f6e472cf190e17651fdfc3daf.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/6a66c38f6e472cf190e17651fdfc3daf.webp?t=1762610521 width=1560 height=868 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTENT WARNINGS:\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killer Chat! Expanded Edition contains references to death, murder, abuse, loss, ableism, and transphobia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET THE SERIALS!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/cd9bb083acc8e151ac055871edce58ca.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/cd9bb083acc8e151ac055871edce58ca.avif?t=1762610521 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/05d826069f5047d44978e70721bd8067.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/05d826069f5047d44978e70721bd8067.avif?t=1762610521 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/ca10eb784232039aacdf6956948aa934.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/ca10eb784232039aacdf6956948aa934.avif?t=1762610521 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/c922f21dae6f47cb213d5c1297d59900.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/c922f21dae6f47cb213d5c1297d59900.avif?t=1762610521 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND THE REST...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(An arsonist, a slasher out of the '90's, a surfer who trips into killing,\u00a0a lonely hearts poisoner... you'll have to play the game, won't'cha?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/35ef871d57f789e0347ea786854217d0.avif?t=1762610521\" width=184 height=184 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3378100?t=1762610521","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3378100?t=1762610521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/c08fe060f4bc40833e05ab93878f90b00d7e844c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762610521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/c08fe060f4bc40833e05ab93878f90b00d7e844c/capsule_184