54e2f8945954.avif?t=1762610521 width=800 height=398 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udec0 Keep yourself guessing with random character events in each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2a Unique relationship dynamics with all characters in every playthrough. Develop wonderful (or  hostile!) relationships with the server members with expanded friendship routes! Be warned - these interactions will now have a significant impact on the plot... and your lifespan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/b78c00ad5a38c445e246fbdcddb4af31.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/b78c00ad5a38c445e246fbdcddb4af31.webp?t=1762610521 width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTSIDE THE CHATROOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As much fun as risking your life lying to a bunch of murderers is, sometimes you need a break. You can now access your PC desktop, where you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdd Write your book (it\u2019s the only reason you\u2019re there, right?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8c Write love letters (okay, maybe not the only reason\u2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play some minigames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude9e Change your appearance with our virtual closet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Keep track of your achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Keep track of your knowledge and relationships with the server... for research purposes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE WHO\u00a0YOU WANT TO BE!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/c652f1a1005f1bf58b2e4896ba464531.avif?t=1762610521\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a customisable MC!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to your appearance, you can customise your:\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd8a\ufe0f\u00a0</strong>Name/Username</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a7\ufe0f\u00a0</strong>Gender\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff3\ufe0f\u200d\ud83c\udf08\u00a0</strong>Sexuality\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2652\u00a0</strong>Personality\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u00a0</strong>Alibi and Moniker (we\u2019re sure you\u2019ll come up with something convincing\u2026)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2a What kind of pseudo serial killer you are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customisation and choices will impact dialogue and relationships, making each playthrough feel more distinct and your MC feel alive (... or dead).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/6a66c38f6e472cf190e17651fdfc3daf.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/6a66c38f6e472cf190e17651fdfc3daf.webp?t=1762610521 width=1560 height=868 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTENT WARNINGS:\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killer Chat! Expanded Edition contains references to death, murder, abuse, loss, ableism, and transphobia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET THE SERIALS!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/cd9bb083acc8e151ac055871edce58ca.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/cd9bb083acc8e151ac055871edce58ca.avif?t=1762610521 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/05d826069f5047d44978e70721bd8067.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/05d826069f5047d44978e70721bd8067.avif?t=1762610521 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/ca10eb784232039aacdf6956948aa934.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/ca10eb784232039aacdf6956948aa934.avif?t=1762610521 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/c922f21dae6f47cb213d5c1297d59900.avif?t=1762610521\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras_big/c922f21dae6f47cb213d5c1297d59900.avif?t=1762610521 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND THE REST...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(An arsonist, a slasher out of the '90's, a surfer who trips into killing,\u00a0a lonely hearts poisoner... you'll have to play the game, won't'cha?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378100/extras/35ef871d57f789e0347ea786854217d0.avif?t=1762610521\" width=184 height=184 /></span></p>","developers":["rosesrot"],"dlc":[3896770,3866420,3901560],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"heade